#, java-printf-format
msgctxt "full_words_title"
msgid "Fully Learned"
msgstr "முழுமையாக கற்றுக்கொண்டது"

#, java-printf-format
msgctxt "full_words_text"
msgid ""
"\"Fully learned words\" means nouns that have been answered correctly 5 times in a row. They are then considered \"fully learned\" and don't appear anymore in the practice screen. The ultimate goal should be to \"fully learn\" all nouns.\n"
"\n"
"If a noun is answered correctly, but then incorrectly before achieving 5 times in a row, it is reset back to 0 and the process of getting 5 times in a row starts again for that noun."
msgstr ""
"\"Fully learned words\" means nouns that have been answered correctly 5 பெருக்கல் in a row. They அரே then considered \"fully learned\" and don't appear anymore in the practice screen. The ultimate goal should be பெறுநர் \"fully learn\" அனைத்தும் nouns.\n"
"\n"
"If a noun is answered correctly, but then incorrectly before achieving 5 பெருக்கல் in a row, it is மீட்டமை பின் பெறுநர் 0 and the process of getting 5 பெருக்கல் in a நிரை starts again க்கு that noun."

